    "q-60014": {
      "dom_id": "step-q60014",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "The following table shows the number of children in a park whose eyes are blue or brown.\n\n| Blue Eyes | Brown Eyes |\n| --- | --- |\n| $22$ | $35$ |\n\nRounding to the nearest ten, find the approximate ratio of the number of children with blue eyes to the number of children with brown eyes.",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's approximate the number of children with blue eyes and the number of children with brown eyes by rounding to the nearest $10$:\n\n- number of children with blue eyes: $22⟶20$\n\n- number of children with brown eyes: $35⟶40$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of children with blue eyes to the number of children with brown eyes is approximately:\n\n$$\n\\frac{20}{40}\n$$\n\nWe can simplify this ratio by dividing both numbers by $10$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{20÷10}{40÷10}=\\frac{2}{4}\n$$\n\nThen, we divide by $2$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2÷2}{4÷2}=\\frac{1}{2}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of children with blue eyes to the number of children with brown eyes is approximately $\\frac{1}{2}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-60014-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{2}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"35\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-60014-b",
